1
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:35,240
The rules keep changing.

2
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:44,080
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

3
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:54,520
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

4
00:00:57,680 --> 00:01:03,160
I am resolved to sever this flood

5
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:09,520
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

6
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:13,880
from loneliness and distinction.

7
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:18,840
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:23,840
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,040
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:29,680
Chase !

11
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,880
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:38,800
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:41,840
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:45,680
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:48,040
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:52,480
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:57,120
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:57,240 --> 00:02:01,680
will be reduced into ashes.

19
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:06,000
What is there to fear ?

20
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,640
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

21
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:32,710
Now,

22
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,200
take me to the Mysterious Yin Cauldron.

23
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:36,830
Naturally...

24
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,750
Naturally...

25
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,230
Ta Shan,

26
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,710
Upper Celestial has already shown you mercy.

27
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,750
Don't be so ungrateful.

28
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,550
Grandpa,

29
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,630
no one knows the Mysterious Yin Cauldron's location better than me.

30
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,110
You're getting old.

31
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,750
As the altar's guardian,

32
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,110
it's my duty to lead the way.

33
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,280
The name "Chosen Immortal Clan"

34
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,590
is because we were chosen by Celestials

35
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,830
and blessed by their grace.

36
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,560
We must guard this place

37
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:11,310
and protect the Mysterious Yin Cauldron until the Celestials return.

38
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,310
This is the mission the Celestials gave us.

39
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,360
Every member of the Chosen Immortal Clan

40
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,590
should take pride in this.

41
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,070
Is that a Celestial ?

42
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,790
Move a little bit,

43
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,070
I want to see too.

44
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,640
When I was their age,

45
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,080
I believed those stories too.

46
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:31,640
Altar
Chosen Immortal Clan

47
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,270
So I cultivated day and night,

48
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,910
I never dared to slack off,

49
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,400
and I became my generation's guardian of the altar.

50
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,750
Chosen Immortal Clan...

51
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,830
Forsaken Immortal Clan...

52
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,270
Their name is almost the same.

53
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:47,400
What's the link between them ?

54
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,840
The Mysterious Yin Cauldron is at the bottom of the cave.

55
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,630
Senior,

56
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:01,750
please.

57
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,680
Do you have something to ask ?

58
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:13,830
Senior,

59
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:14,760
are you...

60
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,750
really a Celestial ?

61
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,350
I'm not.

62
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:21,110
I knew it...

63
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,350
If you suspected me,

64
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,270
why did you bring me in here ?

65
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:28,990
The person who saved our clan

66
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,070
was you,

67
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,310
not that non-existent Celestial.

68
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,880
Although the Celestial Realm has collapsed,

69
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,430
some Celestials might have survived.

70
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:38,360
Even if some did,

71
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:40,790
I'm afraid they abandoned us long ago.

72
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:43,910
What "chosen by Celestials"

73
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,070
and "blessed by their grace"...

74
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,840
Senior, do you know why

75
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,670
this place is overrun with fog beasts ?

76
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,670
The Clan Head certainly never told you.

77
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:52,990
These fog beasts

78
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:55,670
originated from the Mysterious Yin Cauldron itself !

79
00:05:57,520 --> 00:06:00,480
Mysterious Yin Cauldron

80
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,510
That's right.

81
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,070
Ironic, isn't it ?

82
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,190
What our clan protects

83
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,600
is precisely the source of the fog beasts slaughtering our people.

84
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,630
A single word from a Celestial

85
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,720
made us protect it for 30 000 years !

86
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,110
And the result ?

87
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,510
How many of our members

88
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:17,750
haven't lost one of their limbs ?

89
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:20,150
Grandpa always talks of loyalty and righteousness,

90
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,950
but are loyalty and righteousness

91
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:24,310
worth the lives of the entire clan !?

92
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,030
Senior,

93
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,710
Ta Shan has a request.

94
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,430
Now that the clan

95
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,350
sees Senior as a Celestial,

96
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:37,870
no one will disobey

97
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,990
whatever you say.

98
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,790
Junior begs Senior

99
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,230
to lead us away from this place

100
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,830
by using your identity as a Celestial.

101
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:45,910
If you agree,

102
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,710
Ta Shan will serve you for life,

103
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,190
without regard for life or death.

104
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,390
I was also accidentally transported here

105
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,310
and I don't know where the exit is.

106
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,070
Even Senior doesn't know...

107
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:01,030
I led exploration teams several times.

108
00:07:01,490 --> 00:07:02,750
Following the rifts

109
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,470
only led to another dead zone.

110
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,870
This place is surrounded in fleshy walls

111
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:07,830
and has no sky.

112
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,750
Even if we force our way through,

113
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,590
there is only endless void.

114
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:14,070
Surronded in fleshy walls...

115
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,790
Endless void outside...

116
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:20,710
The Celestial Realm has always had a tradition of capturing beasts,

117
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,470
they specialized in rare beasts.

118
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,030
This beast

119
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,870
hides in dark, mysterious places.

120
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,310
Its belly can contain a world.

121
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,070
Its name is

122
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,990
the Nether Beast.

123
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:35,720
This beast's body forms its own formation of restrictions

124
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,030
with netherworld fog as its source.

125
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,470
Where the fog rises

126
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:39,870
is the formation's eye.

127
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,230
To leave this formation,

128
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,070
the formation's eye must be broken.

129
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,110
What is that ?

130
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,680
Cauldron Spirit
Mysterious Yin Cauldron

131
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,750
This sound attacks the Origin Soul directly.

132
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:44,600
Teleport...

133
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:45,560
A teleportation formation !

134
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,630
The exit is hidden beneath the cauldron !

135
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,230
Upper Celestial !

136
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:26,950
Ta Shan,

137
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,070
what did you do !?

138
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:29,950
How did you provoke the Cauldron Spirit's wrath ?

139
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,190
Cauldron Spirit ?

140
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,070
Grandpa,

141
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,640
there's a teleportation formation beneath the cauldron.

142
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:34,950
We just saw it with our own eyes !

143
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,110
Wh...What  ?

144
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:37,710
Impossible.

145
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,110
None of our ancestors ever mentioned it.

146
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,150
But we really saw it !

147
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:43,790
That must be the exit !

148
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,430
Exit ?

149
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:46,790
The exit to leave this place !?

150
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:47,910
Silence !

151
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:51,030
Our clan was ordered to protect this cauldron.

152
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,240
How dare you harbor thoughts of deserting our duty ?

153
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,480
While the cauldron stands,

154
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:55,910
our clan also stands.

155
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,470
Grandpa !

156
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,670
Being forced to kneel for so long

157
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,040
made him servile.

158
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:03,280
Even if the others wish to help,

159
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,470
if he isn't willing,

160
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:05,840
it will all be in vain.

161
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:07,920
You may withdraw,

162
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,320
I will enter seclusion here.

163
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:10,150
Understood.

164
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,230
This place

165
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,630
shall become a forbidden area.

166
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,510
No one will be allowed to disturb Upper Celestial.

167
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,110
I can't stay here long.

168
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,950
The spell that Cauldron Spirit used attacks the Origin Soul.

169
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:24,670
It seems I need to find a way to protect my Origin Soul

170
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,350
before going back in.

171
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,800
I gained quite a lot from the Thunder Celestial Realm.

172
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:31,760
There might be

173
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,670
a solution among the loot.

174
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,110
I need to refine an artifact here

175
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,990
so the three of you will guard me.

176
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,550
100 zhang in all directions,

177
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,510
don't let anyone step in.

178
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,350
Master can rest assured.

179
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,910
Little Xu will protect you to the death.

180
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:47,430
Whoever comes to disturb your cultivation

181
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,510
will have to first step upon my corpse.

182
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,950
I, Xu Liguo, live a life of loyalty and righteousness !

183
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,230
You two,

184
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,310
come with me.

185
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,590
To guard Master,

186
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,750
you must stand your ground.

187
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,590
Just because I stopped flattering him a bit,

188
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,390
and I've already fallen out of favor.

189
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,430
It seems I still need more practice !

190
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,270
I, Xu Liguo,

191
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,750
was born to live a life of loyalty

192
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:15,990
and to fight for righteousness !

193
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,750
This heart, this body,

194
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,870
the heavens and the earth can bear witness !

195
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,390
The Collection Pavilion

196
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:26,670
was my greatest harvest from the Thunder Celestial Realm.

197
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,430
A nine-story pagoda...

198
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,390
How many celestial spells does it contain ?

199
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,080
Unfortunately, the restrictions are hard to break.

200
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,430
I must leave it for later.

201
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,480
This item is extraordinary,

202
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,150
I'll hide it like this

203
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,590
just to be safe.

204
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,150
The Ancient God Leather Armor...

205
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,280
Maybe I can attach it to my Origin Soul.

206
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:23,550
Like this,

207
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:26,390
that Cauldron Spirit can no longer harm me.

208
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,630
This talisman is no ordinary item.

209
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,790
Perhaps I can ask that person from the Thunder Celestial Temple.

210
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,630
What is this ?

211
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:39,310
This...

212
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,190
This is...

213
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:45,120
Fellow cultivator...

214
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,190
Senior ! Spare my life !

215
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,350
I have treasures,

216
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,470
I'll give them all to you !

217
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:50,310
You're just an Origin Soul.

218
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:51,950
How could you have treasures ?

219
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:52,680
I...

220
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:53,240
I have some !

221
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,110
You took my bag of holding

222
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:57,790
but there's a hidden compartment inside

223
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,750
with a restriction !

224
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,190
I'm the only one that can open it !

225
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,270
A defensive artifact ?

226
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,320
It's usable.

227
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,070
What else ?

228
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:15,800
There's more...

229
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:17,270
There's more !

230
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,270
My golden lock !

231
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,590
An ordinary item

232
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,350
isn't enough to buy your life.

233
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:34,990
No...

234
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:35,630
No !

235
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:36,550
I still have some !

236
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,350
I...

237
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:38,150
Right,

238
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:39,470
an Allheaven Stone !

239
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,710
I know you can obtain an Allheaven Stone !

240
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:42,710
If you spare me,

241
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:44,110
I'll lead you there !

242
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:45,990
An Allheaven Stone...

243
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:02,350
A rune ?

244
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,910
I wonder what effect it has.

245
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:13,880
Mosquito Beast,

246
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:14,360
come.

247
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:29,510
A sealing effect ?

248
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,790
This is the true valuable part of his artifact.

249
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:35,470
The messenger that carried the golden lock

250
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,590
truly wasted its potential.

251
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,630
If I could take this rune

252
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,950
and draw a lot of it on an artifact...

253
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:57,150
In that case,

254
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,990
I shall use this sealing rune

255
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:01,390
to bestow my stamp with a spell !

256
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:21,720
8 days later

257
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,590
This stamp

258
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:35,000
shall be named the Celestial Sealing Stamp.

259
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,430
With this stamp,

260
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:39,710
I'll be able to deal with the Cauldron Spirit.

261
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,360
The Celestials ordered them to guard the cauldron,

262
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:46,190
but allowed the fog beasts to slaughter them.

263
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:47,710
All of this

264
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:50,270
feels like a part of a bigger scheme.

265
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,510
If there really is a Celestial manipulating everything behind the scenes,

266
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,430
no matter what he wants to do,

267
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,230
I'll need enough power

268
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:59,150
to break out of here.

269
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,550
If he's still there,

270
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,040
I might have to fight.

271
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:05,790
I need one thing

272
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:07,790
to slay a Celestial.

273
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,470
At Early stage Soul Formation,

274
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,350
by wielding the first God Slaying Chariot,

275
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,790
I could kill Late stage Soul Formation cultivators.

276
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,190
At Soul Transformation,

277
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,990
with the might of the second God Slaying Chariot,

278
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:24,070
I could challenge Early stage Ascendant cultivators.

279
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:26,440
At Ascendant,

280
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,590
by releasing seals of the second God Slaying Chariot,

281
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,230
I was able to fight Illusory Yin cultivators.

282
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:33,960
I wonder what this third God Slaying Chariot

283
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,870
has in store for me.

284
